Subject: [PATCH] LEGO City: the pause menu's language page on the D-pad
 (untested)

The language page (Options, Language) only takes taps on its flags. While
its frame counter moves (overrides/screen_frame_counters.c, slot 7) the
D-pad or left stick moves between the flags, drawn with the map cursor,
and A taps the one chosen. Not yet run.
